	<meta property="og:description" content="What the MDL Provides NASA&#8217;s Mission Design Lab (MDL) provides a collaborative engineering environment for the development of space flight designs and architecture concepts. The key components of the MDL (i.e. people, process, tools and facility) result in a responsive dynamic atmosphere that affords a unique opportunity for accelerated development of design products tailored to &hellip;" />
