<meta name="keywords" content="Engineering, Technology, Spacecraft, Satellites, Instruments, Innovation, NASA, Goddard, Space, Science" />
 
<meta name="description" content="At Goddard, the engineering workforce within ETD develops and builds new technologies that enable spaceflight missions. The engineering staff builds and oversees satellites, instruments, and their operation. The workforce’s new products and processes infuse into the space economy to benefit American technological advancement, capability, and dominance." /><link rel="icon" href="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/nasa-logo-80x80.png" sizes="32x32" />
<link rel="icon" href="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/nasa-logo-300x300.png" sizes="192x192" />
