<div class="mobile-header  wp-block-cover alignfull eplus-wrapper has-no-margin-bottom" style="min-height:701px;aspect-ratio:unset;"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="92" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/idc-header-300x92.png 300w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/idc-header-768x237.png 768w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/idc-header-1024x315.png 1024w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/idc-header.png 1536w" class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-19730" alt="" src="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/idc-header-300x92.png" data-object-fit="cover"/><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-heading-background-color has-background-dim-70 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow">
<div class="has-lg-padding-top has-lg-padding-bottom wp-block-group alignfull has-background-color has-text-color eplus-wrapper has-xl-content-width has-md-padding-bottom"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">
<h1 class="is-style-default cover-text wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color eplus-wrapper has-lg-max-width" style="font-size:70px">Mission Design Lab</h1>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-white-color has-text-color has-background eplus-wrapper has-xl-content-width has-md-padding-top has-no-margin-bottom" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgb(24,30,40) 0%,rgb(39,56,77) 36%,rgb(0,0,0) 72%,rgb(0,0,0) 100%)"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<div class="wp-block-group eplus-wrapper has-md-padding-top has-sm-padding-bottom"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained"><div class="wp-block-columns eplus-wrapper is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex eplus-styles-uid-6730ad">
<div class="wp-block-column eplus-wrapper is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
<div class="wp-block-group eplus-wrapper has-xl-margin-right"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 class=" wp-block-heading has-text-align-center eplus-wrapper">What the MDL Provides</h2>



<p class="eplus-wrapper wp-block-paragraph">NASA&#8217;s Mission Design Lab (MDL) provides a collaborative engineering environment for the development of space flight designs and architecture concepts. The key components of the MDL (i.e. people, process, tools and facility) result in a responsive dynamic atmosphere that affords a unique opportunity for accelerated development of design products tailored to a customer&#8217;s needs. </p>
</div></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column eplus-wrapper is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-default">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized eplus-wrapper"><img decoding="async" width="2016" height="1512" src="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room.jpg" alt="Engineers and science partners work to develop a mission concept in the Mission Design Lab" class="wp-image-19792" style="width:470px;height:auto" srcset="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-300x225.jpg 300w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-400x300.jpg 400w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-768x576.jpg 768w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-800x600.jpg 800w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-1200x900.jpg 1200w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/mdl-room.jpg 2016w" sizes="(max-width: 2016px) 100vw, 2016px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Engineers and science partners work to develop a mission concept in the Mission Design Lab</figcaption></figure>
</div></div>
</div>


<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class=" wp-block-spacer eplus-wrapper"></div>
</div></div>



<div class="idc-study-block wp-block-group eplus-wrapper has-no-content-width has-sm-padding-top has-sm-padding-bottom"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center eplus-wrapper has-xl-max-width"><strong>Range of study options, to match best value to</strong> <strong>concept development needs</strong> or products can be tailored to support customer need&nbsp;</h2>



<p class="has-text-align-center eplus-wrapper has-lg-max-width wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://dataverse.jpl.nasa.gov/dataset.xhtml?persistentId=hdl:2014/44299" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Concept Maturity Levels</a> (CMLs), initially defined by NASA’s Jet Propulsion Laboratory (JPL), provide a standardized tool to advance mission concept designs by assessing the current state of a concept and identifying remaining work to proceed to the next level. &nbsp;<strong>IDC studies can be tailored to support concept maturation from CML 1 through CML 4.&nbsp;</strong></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background eplus-wrapper has-no-margin-top has-xxxl-margin-bottom" style="background-color:#deaf48;color:#deaf48"/>


<div class="mai-columns has-xl-margin-bottom"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xxl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--flex-sm:0 0 100%;--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">
<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:1/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/4;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<i class="fa-solid fa-clock"  style="font-size: 80px; 
 padding-top:10px;" > </i>

</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:3/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:2/3;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<h2 class=" wp-block-heading eplus-wrapper" style="font-size:22px">Office Hours</h2>


<ul class=" wp-block-list eplus-wrapper eplus-styles-uid-b4bac6">
<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Timeframe: ~ 1 hr</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">No/low prep</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Brainstorming Session</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Identify tall poles and key trade studies</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Recommend next steps and point of contact for early engineering support</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--flex-sm:0 0 100%;--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">
<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:1/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/4;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb" style="font-size: 80px; 
 padding-top:10px;"></i>

</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:3/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:2/3;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);">

<h4 class=" wp-block-heading has-text-align-left eplus-wrapper">Concept Development</h4>


<ul class=" wp-block-list eplus-wrapper eplus-styles-uid-a84adc">
<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Timeframe: A few half days</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Potential Products: Concept Feasibility, Risk assessment</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Scope informed by Concept Maturity Level (CML). A CML is a measure of how developed, tested, and ready a concept, idea, or technology is for implementation or deployment.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div></div>

<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xxl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--flex-sm:0 0 100%;--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">
<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:1/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/4;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" style="font-size: 80px; 
 padding-top:10px;"></i>

</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:3/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:2/3;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);">

<h4 class=" wp-block-heading has-text-align-left eplus-wrapper">Tailored Trade Study</h4>


<ul class=" wp-block-list eplus-wrapper eplus-styles-uid-5e7fd9">
<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Timeframe: Variable</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Potential Products: Concept, ConOps, Resources Summary, Trade Tree, possible ROM cost*</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Scope informed by Concept Maturity Level (CML)</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--flex-sm:0 0 100%;--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">
<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:1/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/4;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<i class="fa-solid fa-pencil-alt" style="font-size: 80px; 
 padding-top:10px;" ></i>

</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--flex-xs:0 0 100%;--columns-sm:3/4;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:2/3;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);">

<h4 class=" wp-block-heading has-text-align-left eplus-wrapper">Point Design Study</h4>


<ul class=" wp-block-list eplus-wrapper eplus-styles-uid-509e1d">
<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Timeframe: 6 days</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Products: CAD, MEL, engineering models, CEMA cost</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Entry Criteria: &#8220;Pass&#8221; CML checklist</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>
</div>
</div></div>


<div style="height:50px" aria-hidden="true" class=" wp-block-spacer eplus-wrapper"></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group eplus-wrapper has-sm-padding-top has-xs-padding-bottom"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 class=" wp-block-heading has-text-align-center eplus-wrapper">MDL Capabilities</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background eplus-wrapper has-no-margin-top has-xxl-margin-bottom" style="background-color:#deaf48;color:#deaf48"/>


<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--columns-xs:1/1;--flex-xs:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-sm:1/2;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<figure class=" wp-block-image size-full eplus-wrapper"><img decoding="async" width="764" height="681" src="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/orbit-image-concept.png" alt="Orbit view of space relay communications concept." class="wp-image-19849" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover" srcset="https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/orbit-image-concept-300x267.png 300w, https://etd.gsfc.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/orbit-image-concept.png 764w" sizes="(max-width: 764px) 100vw, 764px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Orbit view of space relay communications concept.</figcaption></figure>

</div>

<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--columns-xs:1/1;--flex-xs:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-sm:1/2;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/2;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/2;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">

<p class="eplus-wrapper wp-block-paragraph">The MDL provides specific engineering analysis and services for mission design and provides end-to-end mission design products with capabilities that include:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>


<ul class=" wp-block-list eplus-wrapper eplus-styles-uid-cf05a5">
<li class=" eplus-wrapper">LEO, GEO, libration, retrograde, drift away, lunar, and deep space orbit design</li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Missions that entail single spacecraft, constellations, formation flying or distributed systems </li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Ground system concept development including services, and products </li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">Launch vehicle accommodations </li>



<li class=" eplus-wrapper">End-of-Mission considerations including controlled and uncontrolled de-orbit, reconnaissance and landing, sample return, etc. </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></div>


<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class=" wp-block-spacer eplus-wrapper"></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group eplus-wrapper has-sm-padding-top has-md-padding-bottom"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center eplus-wrapper has-xl-margin-bottom" id="3-mdl-disciplines">MDL Disciplines</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-text-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-background eplus-wrapper has-no-margin-top has-xxl-margin-bottom" style="background-color:#deaf48;color:#deaf48"/>



<p class="eplus-wrapper wp-block-paragraph">During the study, each system/subsystem prepares material that addresses the requirements, baseline design, alternative designs &amp; trade studies, functional diagrams, interfaces, detailed estimates of mass, power, and data rate, technical risk assessment, issues/concerns, recommendations, models, parametric/grassroots costs, and background information.&nbsp;</p>



<p class="eplus-wrapper wp-block-paragraph"><strong>MDL&#8217;s Discipline Engineering Team provides mission systems expertise across a very broad spectrum, including:</strong>&nbsp;</p>


<div class="mai-columns"><div class="mai-columns-wrap has-columns" style="--column-gap:var(--spacing-xl);--row-gap:0px;--align-columns:start;--align-columns-vertical:initial;">
<div class="mai-column is-column" style="--columns-xs:1/1;--flex-xs:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-sm:1/1;--flex-sm:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-md:1/3;--flex-md:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--columns-lg:1/3;--flex-lg:0 0 var(--flex-basis);--justify-content:start;">
<ul style="padding-left: 1.1em;text-align: left;--ub-list-item-icon-top: 3px;--ub-list-item-icon-size: 0.9em;);--ub-list-item-fa-li-top: 3px;--ub-list-item-spacing: 20px" class="wp-block-ub-styled-list ub_styled_list" id="ub_styled_list-fa394946-1048-47af-aafd-e66c73e53649"><div class="ub-block-list__layout" style="text-align: left; column-count: 1; --ub-list-mobile-column-count: 2; ">
<li class="ub_styled_list_item" style="--ub-list-item-icon-top: 3px; --ub-list-item-icon-size: 0.9em; --ub-list-item-background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill=&quot;%23ffffff&quot; d=&quot;M126.9 142.9c62.2-62.2 162.7-62.5 225.3-1L311 183c-6.9 6.9-8.9 17.2-5.2 26.2s12.5 14.8 22.2 14.8H447.5c0 0 0 0 0 0H456c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V72c0-9.7-5.8-18.5-14.8-22.2s-19.3-1.7-26.2 5.2L397.4 96.6c-87.6-86.5-228.7-86.2-315.8 1C57.2 122 39.6 150.7 28.8 181.4c-5.9 16.7 2.9 34.9 19.5 40.8s34.9-2.9 40.8-19.5c7.7-21.8 20.2-42.3 37.8-59.8zM0 312v7.6 .7V440c0 9.7 5.8 18.5 14.8 22.2s19.3 1.7 26.2-5.2l41.6-41.6c87.6 86.5 228.7 86.2 315.8-1c24.4-24.4 42.1-53.1 52.9-83.7c5.9-16.7-2.9-34.9-19.5-40.8s-34.9 2.9-40.8 19.5c-7.7 21.8-20.2 42.3-37.8 59.8c-62.2 62.2-162.7 62.5-225.3 1L169 329c6.9-6.9 8.9-17.2 5.2-26.2s-12.5-14.8-22.2-14.8H32.4h-.7H24c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;'); " id="ub-styled-list-item-be67f12f-0ed9-4f3a-95e9-2f104c7f0868">
			<div class="ub_list_item_content">
				<span class="ub_list_item_icon">
					<svg width="0.9em" height="0.9em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 512 512">
						<path fill="#ffffff" d="M126.9 142.9c62.2-62.2 162.7-62.5 225.3-1L311 183c-6.9 6.9-8.9 17.2-5.2 26.2s12.5 14.8 22.2 14.8H447.5c0 0 0 0 0 0H456c13.3 0 24-10.7 24-24V72c0-9.7-5.8-18.5-14.8-22.2s-19.3-1.7-26.2 5.2L397.4 96.6c-87.6-86.5-228.7-86.2-315.8 1C57.2 122 39.6 150.7 28.8 181.4c-5.9 16.7 2.9 34.9 19.5 40.8s34.9-2.9 40.8-19.5c7.7-21.8 20.2-42.3 37.8-59.8zM0 312v7.6 .7V440c0 9.7 5.8 18.5 14.8 22.2s19.3 1.7 26.2-5.2l41.6-41.6c87.6 86.5 228.7 86.2 315.8-1c24.4-24.4 42.1-53.1 52.9-83.7c5.9-16.7-2.9-34.9-19.5-40.8s-34.9 2.9-40.8 19.5c-7.7 21.8-20.2 42.3-37.8 59.8c-62.2 62.2-162.7 62.5-225.3 1L169 329c6.9-6.9 8.9-17.2 5.2-26.2s-12.5-14.8-22.2-14.8H32.4h-.7H24c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24z"></path>
					</svg>
